{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-01-18 14:00:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ FINES SPEEDROUTE $450,000 FOR MARKET ACCESS AND SUPERVISION VIOLATIONS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JAN. 18, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET, LLC (“NASDAQ”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT CENSURED SPEEDROUTE LLC (“SPEEDROUTE”) AND FINED THE FIRM $450,000 FOR VIOLATING VARIOUS PROVISIONS OF RULE 15C3-5 OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 (KNOWN AS THE MARKET ACCESS RULE) OVER A NEARLY FIVE-YEAR PERIOD, FROM JANUARY 2017 THROUGH NOVEMBER 2021. AS A RESULT OF THESE VIOLATIONS, THE FIRM FAILED TO PREVENT THE TRANSMISSION OF NUMEROUS ERRONEOUS ORDERS, RESULTING IN THE FILING OF 30 CLEARLY ERRONEOUS EXECUTION PETITIONS.'}